{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "LEV",
  "chapter": 18,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD spoke to Moses, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Speak to the children of Israel, and say to them, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD your God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "After the doings of the land of Egypt in which ye dwelt, shall ye not do: and after the doings of the land of Canaan whither I bring you, shall ye not do: neither shall ye walk in their ordinances.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye shall perform my judgments, and keep my ordinances, to walk in them; I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD your God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye shall therefore keep my statutes and my judgments: which if a man doeth, he shall live in them: I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "None of you shall approach to any that is near of kin to him, to uncover ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " nakedness: I am the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The nakedness of thy father, or the nakedness of thy mother, shalt thou not uncover: she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy mother, thou shalt not uncover her nakedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The nakedness of thy father's wife shalt thou not uncover: it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy father's nakedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The nakedness of thy sister, the daughter of thy father, or daughter of thy mother, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "whether",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " born at home, or born abroad, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their nakedness thou shalt not uncover.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The nakedness of thy son's daughter, or of thy daughter's daughter, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their nakedness thou shalt not uncover: for theirs ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy own nakedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The nakedness of thy father's wife's daughter, begotten by thy father, (she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy sister) thou shalt not uncover her nakedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not uncover the nakedness of thy father's sister: she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy father's near kinswoman.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not uncover the nakedness of thy mother's sister: for she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy mother's near kinswoman.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not uncover the nakedness of thy father's brother, thou shalt not approach to his wife: she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy aunt.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not uncover the nakedness of thy daughter-in-law: she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy son's wife, thou shalt not uncover her nakedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not uncover the nakedness of thy brother's wife: it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy brother's nakedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not uncover the nakedness of a woman and her daughter, neither shalt thou take her son's daughter, or her daughter's daughter, to uncover her nakedness; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " her near kinswomen: it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wickedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither shalt thou take a wife to her sister, to vex ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "her",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", to uncover her nakedness besides the other in her life -",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": " time",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also thou shalt not approach to a woman to uncover her nakedness, as long as she is put apart for her uncleanness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Moreover, thou shalt not lie carnally with thy neighbor's wife, to defile thyself with her.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt not let any of thy seed pass through ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the fire",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to Molech, neither shalt thou profane the name of thy God: I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not lie with mankind, as with womankind: it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " abomination.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither shalt thou lie with any beast to defile thyself therewith: neither shall any woman stand before a beast to lie down thereto: it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " confusion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Defile not ye yourselves in any of these things; for in all these the nations are defiled which I cast out before you:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the land is defiled: therefore I do visit its iniquity upon it, and the land itself vomiteth out her inhabitants.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye shall therefore keep my statutes and my judgments, and shall not commit ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of these abominations; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "neither",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " any of your own nation, nor any stranger that sojourneth among you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "(For all these abominations have the men of the land done, who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before you, and the land is defiled;)",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That the land may not vomit you out also, when ye defile it, as it vomited out the nations that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For whoever shall commit any of these abominations, even the souls that commit ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be cut off from among their people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.18.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.18.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore shall ye keep my ordinance, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "ye",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " commit not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of these abominable customs, which were committed before you, and that ye defile not yourselves in them; I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD your God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
